<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:58Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Greece returns remains of Czar Samuel to Bulgaria</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:78386e5627a45cd574cdb36a49c6309f2c16aca45381844d2acc8d6d0d205ebc</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T12:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/greece-returns-remains-of-czar-samuel-to-bulgaria/a-79530104--e4eab7810bf7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/greece-returns-remains-of-czar-samuel-to-bulgaria/a-79530104?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A warrior emperor who ruled the Bulgarian Empire in the Middle Ages, Czar Samuel is a symbol of Bulgarian national identity. But his remains have been in Greece for decades – and he is also claimed by North Macedonia.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Spain: Floods leave 102-year-old woman dead in southeast</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a92aa0192e81043b857eef68de82ca0968dfc843bb04b94c5e04ca9ee8fa8f17</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:37Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T12:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-floods-leave-102-year-old-woman-dead-in-southeast/a-79529983--d4597da5456b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-floods-leave-102-year-old-woman-dead-in-southeast/a-79529983?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Authorities in Spain rescued some 90 people after heavy rain sparked flooding in the town of Madrigueras. Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez expressed his condolences to the family of a 102-year-old woman who died.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>On German Unity Day, Steinmeier laments 'bitter setbacks'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ee6372dc7c8fb097424e1b342a81360d884fcff47fb476246ac24e0a56fe2960</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T10:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/on-german-unity-day-steinmeier-laments-bitter-setbacks/live-79528092--4d5945f39bb2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/on-german-unity-day-steinmeier-laments-bitter-setbacks/live-79528092?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's president has used his final Unity Day speech to warn the hopes of the reunification era have suffered "bitter setbacks." DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Cockroach Janta Party announces Delhi march for October 10, calls for election chief's resignation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6472fe6c8e566e66830c843cd39f05925b24ebb2e7cf0d5c77572e787c7ce588</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T10:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-cockroach-janta-party-announces-delhi-march-for-october-10-calls-for-election-chief-s-res/live-79527537--f1f6a3f98858.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-cockroach-janta-party-announces-delhi-march-for-october-10-calls-for-election-chief-s-resignation/live-79527537?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Cockroach Janta Party has called for a protest in Delhi if Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar does not resign. After the Indian men's cricket team struck gold, all eyes are on their hockey counterparts.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia strikes another major bridge in Kyiv, says mayor</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:912e738e1c2e009ad8bbb90c1248ebaa6cb7ab823144cce217b86316a2d6b7ac</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T08:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-strikes-another-major-bridge-in-kyiv-says-mayor/a-79527753--95b1585293f8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-strikes-another-major-bridge-in-kyiv-says-mayor/a-79527753?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The attack on Kyiv's Northern Bridge comes after the Southern Bridge on the Dnipro river was hit multiple times by Russia's drones.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Flydubai co-pilot attempted 'terrorist attack,' UAE says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f7695adae8b830157f48381c5616ef51401e4d0829d058b0b46b5bcde61675f7</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T08:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/flydubai-co-pilot-attempted-terrorist-attack-uae-says/a-79526641--5d350a043c31.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/flydubai-co-pilot-attempted-terrorist-attack-uae-says/a-79526641?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The man, who stabbed his fellow pilot on an Israel-bound Flydubai flight, was reportedly barred from flying in his native Oman over security concerns.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Morocco's first female head of government: Symbol or real reform?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:841180c718fa51f1c1908839b2ef2c340b78075306085fb48b955acfa0e05667</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:52Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T08:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/morocco-s-first-female-head-of-government-symbol-or-real-reform/a-79521808--5c6131d5d637.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/morocco-s-first-female-head-of-government-symbol-or-real-reform/a-79521808?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fatima Zahra Mansouri has been chosen as Morocco's first female prime minister. Is her appointment a kind of symbolism, to show Morocco in a positive light? Or could Mansouri bring genuine changes for Moroccan women?</summary><category term="Africa" /></entry><entry><title>Bosnia-Herzegovina shaped by war, separatism, EU ambitions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f9cc478ab179d1c4dc4c2d1e0800571be0e41a8dcc8a4f22b64ba4c0980f927d</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:55Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T06:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bosnia-herzegovina-shaped-by-war-separatism-eu-ambitions/a-79523557--2bb293050c24.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bosnia-herzegovina-shaped-by-war-separatism-eu-ambitions/a-79523557?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bosnia-Herzegovina is governed by a system established after the Bosnian war — more than 30 years ago. Ethnic divisions, a complex administration and European integration all shape the country's political reality.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Latvia votes in parliamentary election amid rising costs</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:efe23ac73bb1b5b1b9693e3265f6b6f91b14cc00e1600c3829a5168d115df9f9</id><updated>2026-10-03T13:32:58Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T06:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/latvia-votes-in-parliamentary-election-amid-rising-costs/a-79527253--730671a31a16.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/latvia-votes-in-parliamentary-election-amid-rising-costs/a-79527253?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Around 1.5 million Latvians are eligible to vote in an election which has been dominated by national security concerns and rising living costs. Four Eurofighter jets are on NATO deployment over Latvia during the poll.</summary><category term="N